      "user_title": "User",
      "username": "vladios13"
    },
    {
      "attach_count": 0,
      "attachments": [],
      "id": 80127,
      "is_admin": false,
      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "В файле posting_editor.tpl можно добавить какие угодно.",
      "message_state": "visible",
      "position": 1,
      "post_date": 1427110356,
      "user_id": 462,
      "user_title": "User",
      "username": "Virtuoz"
    },
    {
      "attach_count": 0,
      "attachments": [],
      "id": 80128,
      "is_admin": false,
      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 1427110878,
      "message_parsed": "Я понимаю но как мне его подключить? Возьмем самый простой Шрифт Lobster на <a href=\"http://www.google.com/fonts/#QuickUsePlace:quickUse\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Google Fonts</a>. Как мне его добавить в <i><u>posting_editor.tpl</u></i>?<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">&lt;option style=&quot;font-family: Courier&quot; value=&quot;Courier&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Courier&lt;/option&gt;\n   &lt;option style=&quot;font-family: Courier New&quot; value=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Courier New&lt;/option&gt;</pre>",
      "message_state": "visible",
      "position": 2,
      "post_date": 1427110685,
      "user_id": 4602,
      "user_title": "User",
      "username": "vladios13"
    },
    {
      "attach_count": 0,
      "attachments": [],
      "id": 80132,
      "is_admin": false,
      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "Найти &lt;select name=&quot;fontFace&quot;&gt;<br />\nи ниже вставить <br />\n&lt;option style=&quot;font-family: Google Fonts&quot; value=&quot;Google Fonts&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Google Fonts&lt;/option&gt;",
      "message_state": "visible",
      "position": 3,
      "post_date": 1427111487,
      "user_id": 5626,
      "user_title": "Blocked",
      "username": "Kryl"
    },
